##############################################################################
  S1: FitLane Gym - Class Booking Web App
  S2: FitLane Gym runs group fitness classes at one branch.
  S3: We need a web application that works in desktop and mobile browsers.
  S4: It has two user groups: members and front-desk staff.
  S5: Staff create classes with a name, instructor, start time and capacity.
  S6: Members can book a class up to 7 days before it starts.
  S7: Members can only book classes that staff have already created.
  S8: When a class reaches its capacity, booking closes and members see the message "Class full".
  S9: Members can cancel a booking up to 2 hours before the class starts.
  S10: Cancelling frees the place for another member.
  S11: Staff can view the list of members booked into each class and print it.
  S12: Members receive a booking confirmation after they book.
  S13: Booking and cancellation are high priority.
  S14: The printable list is low priority.
  S15: The app must launch on 15 March 2027.
  S16: Members identify themselves with their membership number.

